The ViperX geometry and calibrated MuJoCo arm model are derived from the
MuJoCo Menagerie ALOHA model, licensed under BSD-3-Clause. The bundled copy of
that license is in LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt.

The PiPER MuJoCo model and meshes are derived from the MuJoCo Menagerie
AgileX PiPER model, licensed under MIT. The bundled copy of that license is in
LICENSES/AgileX-PiPER-MIT.txt.

The Mobile ALOHA body, Tracer base, and leader/follower end-effector meshes
are derived from https://github.com/agilexrobotics/mobile_aloha_sim at revision
f799ae0192c0c2bbd502ec4d9bbec8c2633acd1a. Its aloha_new_description package
declares the assets under BSD.

The mobile base is a simplified Tracer-compatible differential-drive model intended
for controller integration tests; it is not a calibrated dynamics model.
